  "business_overview": "American Rebel Holdings, Inc. designs, manufactures, and markets branded safes, and personal security and self-defense products under the American Rebel brand in the United States. The company also designs and produces branded apparel and accessories for men and women. In addition, it offers beer under the American Rebel Light Beer brand. Further, the company provides backpacks, jackets, and related accessories. The company markets its products through dealers; regional retailers; and specialty safe, sporting goods, hunting, and firearms stores, as well as online through its own website and e-commerce platforms. American Rebel Holdings, Inc. was incorporated in 2014 and is based in Nashville, Tennessee.",
